{
  "id": "p33",
  "title": "The Battle for the Baths",
  "titleZh": "浴场保卫战",
  "topic": "温泉小镇公共浴场",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My town keeps a rare public bath from the eighteenth century.",
        "zh": "我的小镇保留着一座稀有的公共浴场，建于十八世纪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small fund buys pepper, a pan, and clean water.",
        "zh": "一笔小小的基金买来胡椒、一口锅和干净的水。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A new report shows serious pollution, and the response is awful.",
        "zh": "一份新报告显示严重污染，回应却糟透了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The administration calls a long meeting, and the politics turn ugly.",
        "zh": "当局召开了一场漫长的会议，政治气氛变得难看。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An independent regulator will file a formal report with the town soon.",
        "zh": "一家独立监管机构很快会向镇里提交正式报告。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a citizen starts a movement and a hard struggle.",
        "zh": "接着一位市民发起运动，也开启了一场艰难的斗争。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A retired colonel leads the rally with a steady voice.",
        "zh": "一位退役上校用沉稳的声音带领集会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young lad carries a chart of the town's water use.",
        "zh": "一个少年拿着一幅全镇用水的图表。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We admire his soul, and his lip begins to tremble with emotion.",
        "zh": "我们钦佩他的心灵，他的嘴唇开始因激动而颤抖。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He asks every shopping street to sign and register quiet support.",
        "zh": "他请每条商业街签名，悄悄登记支持。"
      },
      {
        "en": "People switch their signs, and the crowd begins to block the road.",
        "zh": "人们调转标语牌，人群开始堵住道路。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The crisis is immediate, and the view is grim.",
        "zh": "危机迫在眉睫，前景一片黯淡。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A young designer refers to the temple in her careful plan.",
        "zh": "一位年轻设计师在她细致的方案里提到了那座神庙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She will decorate the main hall and frame each old stone column.",
        "zh": "她要装饰大厅，并为每根古老石柱装上框架。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The plan respects the era and highlights the hall's simple beauty.",
        "zh": "方案尊重那个时代，也突出了大厅朴素的美。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her drawings strip away the rot and show a complicated shape.",
        "zh": "她的图纸剥去腐朽，露出一个复杂的轮廓。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The final design is clear, and the cost stays within a modest scale.",
        "zh": "最终设计很清楚，成本也控制在适度的规模内。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She can generate profit and still keep the water public.",
        "zh": "她能创造利润，同时让水保持公用。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My neighbour sees profit, and his offer is awful.",
        "zh": "我的邻居看到了利润，他的出价却很糟糕。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An allegation of bribery reaches the town's tired old attorney.",
        "zh": "一桩受贿指控传到镇上那位疲惫的老律师耳中。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the attorney will open the case and study every trail.",
        "zh": "接着律师将立案，并研究每一条线索。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A missile test fills the global news for that whole week.",
        "zh": "那周一枚导弹试验占满了全球新闻。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The local medium covers a missile import and forgets the town.",
        "zh": "本地媒体只报道导弹进口，却忘了这座小镇。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our campaign cannot dominate the news, and inflation rises.",
        "zh": "我们的运动无法主导新闻，通胀还在上升。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later a republican senator visits and admires the plan.",
        "zh": "后来一位共和党参议员来访，称赞这份方案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My town's bath has a small capacity of thirty people.",
        "zh": "我镇上的浴场容量很小，只能容纳三十人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He vows to fight for the fund and remind the whole assembly.",
        "zh": "他誓言为基金奔走，并提醒整个议会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Eventually the court sends one corrupt clerk to the town jail.",
        "zh": "最终，法庭把一个贪腐的职员送进了镇上的监狱。"
      }
    ]
  ],
